1
00:00:07,465 --> 00:00:08,758
Have you two gotten close?

2
00:00:10,719 --> 00:00:12,262
Yes, Professor.

3
00:00:14,055 --> 00:00:15,055
I see.

4
00:00:21,688 --> 00:00:23,356
Play it more elaborately.

5
00:00:23,982 --> 00:00:24,982
But

6
00:00:25,275 --> 00:00:26,513
that might put Dong-uk

7
00:00:26,514 --> 00:00:27,652
at a disadvantage.

8
00:00:27,653 --> 00:00:29,946
Dong-uk needs a push.

9
00:00:30,697 --> 00:00:31,990
Dong-uk seems like

10
00:00:31,990 --> 00:00:32,797
the kind of person

11
00:00:32,798 --> 00:00:33,798
who'll excel regardless.

12
00:00:34,200 --> 00:00:35,116
I don't think

13
00:00:35,117 --> 00:00:36,035
that's a good idea.

14
00:00:36,036 --> 00:00:38,246
Just do as I say.

15
00:00:38,246 --> 00:00:39,184
You just give

16
00:00:39,185 --> 00:00:40,164
your best performance

17
00:00:40,165 --> 00:00:41,708
in the practice room.

18
00:00:42,667 --> 00:00:43,764
Oh, and just to be clear

19
00:00:43,765 --> 00:00:44,912
don't say anything

20
00:00:44,913 --> 00:00:46,296
