21
00:00:47,088 --> 00:00:48,423
And no funny business either.

22
00:00:52,886 --> 00:00:54,429
Nevermind.

23
00:00:54,429 --> 00:00:55,706
I doubt you two

24
00:00:55,707 --> 00:00:56,927
could get close anyway.

25
00:00:57,542 --> 00:00:58,626
Dong-uk's bound to be

26
00:00:58,641 --> 00:01:00,935
jealous of your talent.

27
00:01:01,478 --> 00:01:02,979
That jealousy will push him

28
00:01:02,979 --> 00:01:04,688
to perform on a higher level.

29
00:01:16,034 --> 00:01:17,744
Professor Park

30
00:01:17,744 --> 00:01:19,788
I spoke with Dong-uk.

31
00:01:19,788 --> 00:01:20,823
He said he hadn't heard

32
00:01:20,824 --> 00:01:21,997
about the scholarship

33
00:01:21,998 --> 00:01:23,833
so I told him in advance.

34
00:01:23,833 --> 00:01:25,126
Yes, thank you.

35
00:01:25,126 --> 00:01:26,075
I'll make sure

36
00:01:26,076 --> 00:01:27,044
to inform him again.

37
00:01:27,045 --> 00:01:28,505
By the way

38
00:01:28,505 --> 00:01:29,857
why did you recommend

39
00:01:29,858 --> 00:01:31,250
Dong-uk for the scholarship?

40
00:01:31,591 --> 00:01:33,927
It seemed like a close call.

41
00:01:33,927 --> 00:01:35,178
It's because he was

42
00:01:35,178 --> 00:01:36,429
better.

43
00:01:36,846 --> 00:01:38,223
Alright.
